  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29309001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "弗吉尼娅，你为什么一直盯着我看？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29309002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29309003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我的脸上有东西吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29309004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29309005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "还是，你是有什么话想对我说？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29309006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "我并没有盯着你，我正好在寻找目标……然后你就出现了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29309007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "哦……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29309008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "……你和我之前遇到的人不一样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29309009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "那些家伙总是试图背叛我，所以都为此付出了代价。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29309010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "而你是一个好人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29309011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是吗……哈哈……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29309012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "你最好永远对我忠诚，不然我会让你体会到我的痛楚。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29309013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "当然，我不能保证这样你就是安全的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29309014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "啊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29309015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "——因为，我也喜欢玷污美好的东西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
